  "pinned": false,
  "description": "## Conversation Summary\n\n1. **Goal**: Add \"summary management\" functionality to the Knowledge Settings UI and API in the `codx-junior` project.\n2. **Backend**: Three new REST endpoints were added to `api/codx/junior/api/knowledge.py` \u2014 `GET`, `POST`, and `DELETE` on `/api/knowledge/summary` \u2014 delegating to the existing `Knowledge` class methods (`get_project_summary`, `build_project_summary`).\n3. **Frontend Component**: A new `KnowledgeSummary.vue` component was created with **fetch / rebuild / delete** actions, status badges, a collapsible markdown preview, and a delete confirmation modal.\n4. **Settings Tab**: A new `KnowledgeSettings.vue` wrapper was introduced to host both `KnowledgeSearch` and `KnowledgeSummary` under a **Search / Summary** tab bar.\n5. **API Wiring**: The three client-side API methods (`summary()`, `rebuildSummary()`, `deleteSummary()`) already existed in `api.js` and required no changes, mapping directly to the new backend routes.",
