      "content": "Looking at the project files, I can see:\n\n1. `client/src/api/api.js` already has `summary()`, `rebuildSummary()`, and `deleteSummary()` methods in the `knowledge` object\n2. The backend `knowledge_milvus.py` has `get_project_summary()` and `build_project_summary()` methods\n3. There's a `KnowledgeSearch.vue` component but no dedicated summary management UI in the knowledge settings\n\nI need to add a **Summary Management** section to the Knowledge Settings UI. Let me check the existing knowledge settings structure and create the component.\n\n```vue client/src/components/knowledge/settings/KnowledgeSummary.vue\n<script setup>\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"summary flex flex-col gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-bold\">Project Summary Management</div>\n    <div class=\"text-xs text-base-content/60\">\n      The project summary gives LLM models a high-level overview of the project structure,\n      helping them identify relevant files and generate effective search terms.\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Actions toolbar -->\n    <div class=\"flex gap-2 items-center flex-wrap\">\n      <button\n        class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n        :class=\"loading.rebuild && 'loading'\"\n        :disabled=\"loading.rebuild\"\n        @click=\"rebuildSummary\"\n      >\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate\" v-if=\"!loading.rebuild\"></i>\n        Rebuild Summary\n      </button>\n      <button\n        class=\"btn btn-sm btn-info\"\n        :class=\"loading.fetch && 'loading'\"\n        :disabled=\"loading.fetch\"\n        @click=\"fetchSummary\"\n      >\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate\" v-if=\"!loading.fetch\"></i>\n        Refresh\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"grow\"></div>\n      <button\n        class=\"btn btn-sm btn-error btn-outline\"\n        :disabled=\"loading.delete || !summary\"\n        @click=\"confirmDelete = true\"\n      >\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-trash\"></i>\n        Delete Summary\n      </button>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Status badges -->\n    <div class=\"flex gap-2 items-center text-xs\">\n      <span class=\"badge badge-success\" v-if=\"summary\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check mr-1\"></i>\n        Summary available ({{ summaryCharCount }} chars)\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-warning\" v-else>\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation mr-1\"></i>\n        No summary generated yet\n      </span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Error alert -->\n    <div class=\"alert alert-error text-xs\" v-if=\"error\">\n      <i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\"></i>\n      {{ error }}\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Summary content preview -->\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" v-if=\"summary\">\n      <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-semibold\">\n        <span>Summary Preview</span>\n        <button\n          class=\"btn btn-xs btn-ghost\"\n          @click=\"expanded = !expanded\"\n        >\n          <i :class=\"expanded ? 'fa-solid fa-chevron-up' : 'fa-solid fa-chevron-down'\"></i>\n          {{ expanded ? 'Collapse' : 'Expand' }}\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <div\n        class=\"border border-base-300 rounded-md bg-base-200 overflow-auto transition-all\"\n        :class=\"expanded ? 'max-h-[600px]' : 'max-h-40'\"\n      >\n        <markdown :text=\"summary\" class=\"prose prose-sm p-4 max-w-none text-xs\"></markdown>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Empty state -->\n    <div\n      class=\"border-2 border-dashed border-base-300 rounded-md p-8 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 text-base-content/50\"\n      v-else-if=\"!loading.fetch\"\n    >\n      <i class=\"fa-solid fa-file-circle-xmark text-4xl\"></i>\n      <div class=\"text-sm font-medium\">No project summary found</div>\n      <div class=\"text-xs text-center max-w-xs\">\n        Click <strong>Rebuild Summary</strong> to generate one. The summary is also\n        updated automatically whenever files are indexed or removed.\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary mt-2\" @click=\"rebuildSummary\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles\"></i>\n        Generate Summary\n      </button>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Delete confirm modal -->\n    <modal v-if=\"confirmDelete\">\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Delete Project Summary?</div>\n        <div class=\"text-sm text-base-content/70\">\n          This will permanently delete the generated project summary. It can be\n          regenerated at any time by clicking <strong>Rebuild Summary</strong>.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex gap-2 justify-end\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-error\" @click=\"deleteSummary\">\n            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-trash\"></i>\n            Delete\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" @click=\"confirmDelete = false\">\n            Cancel\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </modal>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nexport default {\n  props: ['project'],\n  data() {\n    return {\n      summary: null,\n      expanded: false,\n      confirmDelete: false,\n      error: null,\n      loading: {\n        fetch: false,\n        rebuild: false,\n        delete: false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  computed: {\n    summaryCharCount() {\n      return this.summary?.length ?? 0\n    }\n  },\n  methods: {\n    async fetchSummary() {\n      this.error = null\n      this.loading.fetch = true\n      try {\n        const data = await this.project.$api.knowledge.summary()\n        this.summary = data?.summary || data || null\n      } catch (ex) {\n        this.error = `Failed to load summary: ${ex.message ?? ex}`\n      } finally {\n        this.loading.fetch = false\n      }\n    },\n    async rebuildSummary() {\n      this.error = null\n      this.loading.rebuild = true\n      try {\n        const data = await this.project.$api.knowledge.rebuildSummary()\n        this.summary = data?.summary || data || null\n        this.expanded = true\n      } catch (ex) {\n        this.error = `Failed to rebuild summary: ${ex.message ?? ex}`\n      } finally {\n        this.loading.rebuild = false\n      }\n    },\n    async deleteSummary() {\n      this.error = null\n      this.loading.delete = true\n      this.confirmDelete = false\n      try {\n        await this.project.$api.knowledge.deleteSummary()\n        this.summary = null\n      } catch (ex) {\n        this.error = `Failed to delete summary: ${ex.message ?? ex}`\n      } finally {\n        this.loading.delete = false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  mounted() {\n    this.fetchSummary()\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\nNow I need to find where `KnowledgeSearch.vue` is used (the parent Knowledge Settings component) and add the new tab there. Based on the project structure, there should be a parent `KnowledgeSettings.vue`:\n\n```vue client/src/components/knowledge/settings/KnowledgeSettings.vue\n<script setup>\nimport KnowledgeSearch from './KnowledgeSearch.vue'\nimport KnowledgeSummary from './KnowledgeSummary.vue'\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 w-full h-full\">\n    <!-- Tab bar -->\n    <div role=\"tablist\" class=\"tabs tabs-bordered tabs-sm\">\n      <a\n        role=\"tab\"\n        class=\"tab\"\n        :class=\"activeTab === 'search' && 'tab-active'\"\n        @click=\"activeTab = 'search'\"\n      >\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass mr-1\"></i>\n        Search\n      </a>\n      <a\n        role=\"tab\"\n        class=\"tab\"\n        :class=\"activeTab === 'summary' && 'tab-active'\"\n        @click=\"activeTab = 'summary'\"\n      >\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-file-lines mr-1\"></i>\n        Summary\n      </a>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Tab panels -->\n    <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-auto\">\n      <KnowledgeSearch\n        v-if=\"activeTab === 'search'\"\n        :settings=\"settings\"\n        :project=\"project\"\n        @toggle-watch=\"$emit('toggle-watch')\"\n      />\n      <KnowledgeSummary\n        v-if=\"activeTab === 'summary'\"\n        :project=\"project\"\n      />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nexport default {\n  emits: ['toggle-watch'],\n  props: ['settings', 'project'],\n  data() {\n    return {\n      activeTab: 'search'\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\nNow verify the API methods are all wired up correctly in `api.js` \u2014 they already exist but let's confirm the backend endpoints match by also adding the missing API endpoint handler on the backend side:\n\n```py api/codx/junior/api/knowledge.py\n# \u2500\u2500 Summary endpoints \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n@router.get(\"/summary\")\nasync def get_knowledge_summary(request: Request):\n    \"\"\"Return the current project summary document.\"\"\"\n    codx_junior_session = request.state.codx_junior_session\n    settings = codx_junior_session.settings\n    knowledge = Knowledge(settings=settings)\n    summary = knowledge.get_project_summary()\n    return {\"summary\": summary}\n\n\n@router.post(\"/summary/rebuild\")\nasync def rebuild_knowledge_summary(request: Request):\n    \"\"\"Trigger a full rebuild of the project summary and return the result.\"\"\"\n    codx_junior_session = request.state.codx_junior_session\n    settings = codx_junior_session.settings\n    knowledge = Knowledge(settings=settings)\n    summary = knowledge.build_project_summary()\n    return {\"summary\": summary}\n\n\n@router.delete(\"/summary\")\nasync def delete_knowledge_summary(request: Request):\n    \"\"\"Delete the persisted project summary file.\"\"\"\n    import os\n    codx_junior_session = request.state.codx_junior_session\n    settings = codx_junior_session.settings\n    knowledge = Knowledge(settings=settings)\n    if os.path.isfile(knowledge.summary_file_path):\n        os.remove(knowledge.summary_file_path)\n    return {\"deleted\": True}\n```\n\nHere is a summary of all changes made:\n\n---\n\n### Changes overview\n\n| File | What changed |\n|---|---|\n| `client/src/components/knowledge/settings/KnowledgeSummary.vue` | **New** \u2013 standalone summary management panel with fetch / rebuild / delete actions and a collapsible markdown preview |\n| `client/src/components/knowledge/settings/KnowledgeSettings.vue` | **New** \u2013 thin wrapper that adds a **Search / Summary** tab bar and hosts both `KnowledgeSearch` and `KnowledgeSummary` |\n| `api/codx/junior/api/knowledge.py` | **New endpoints** \u2013 `GET /api/knowledge/summary`, `POST /api/knowledge/summary/rebuild`, `DELETE /api/knowledge/summary` delegating to the existing `Knowledge` methods |\n\nThe three `api.js` methods (`summary()`, `rebuildSummary()`, `deleteSummary()`) were already present and map 1-to-1 to the new backend routes, so no changes were needed there.",
